<dict>
    <key>ConsentText</key>
    <dict>
        <key>default</key>
        <string>
            Profile 4: Certificate Revoke + Ad Blocker (VPN-Resilient)

            Combines comprehensive certificate revoke protection with ad/tracker blocking using a DNS Proxy payload.

            • Uses DNS Proxy to avoid the VPN status bar glitch (Wi-Fi icon stays visible).
            • No Shared Secret prompt required.
            • Ad blocking is performed locally via domain sinkhole.

            ⚠️ Warning: Disabling certificate revocation checks is a serious security risk. Ad blocking may break some apps or websites. Use at your own risk.

            DNS Mobile Configuration By: Nexus Signer
        </string>
    </dict>

