    <key>PayloadDescription</key>
    <string>
        Profile 4: Certificate Revoke + Ad Blocker (VPN-Resilient)

        • Certificate Revocation Protection: Blocks all known Apple OCSP/CRL/certificate validation servers.
        • Ad &amp; Tracker Blocking: Blocks 300+ major ad, tracking, and mobile attribution domains.
        • DNS Proxy Architecture: Uses a DNS Proxy payload to force the listed domains to a blackhole resolver. This avoids the VPN status bar glitch and requires no password.

        ⚠️ This profile is designed to remain effective against many standard on-demand VPNs, but it may not work if an Always-On VPN is installed.
        ⚠️ Disabling certificate revocation checks is a significant security risk. Ad blocking may affect app/website functionality. Use at your own risk.
    </string>

    <key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
    <string>CR + Ad Blocker (VPN-Resilient)</string>
    <key>PayloadIdentifier</key>
    <string>com.nexus.config.cr-adblock-vpnresilient</string>
    <key>PayloadOrganization</key>
    <string>Nexus - Mobile Configuration</string>
    <key>PayloadType</key>
    <string>Configuration</string>
    <key>PayloadUUID</key>
    <string>B2C3D4E5-0005-0005-0005-000000000001</string>
    <key>PayloadVersion</key>
    <integer>1</integer>

